### Chave lida de api/.env via symlink requests/.env -> ../../../.env
@baseUrl = https://places.googleapis.com/v1
@placeId = ChIJoZR7BIe_nJMRPRDd0j6K4Q0

### Place Details — mesmo field mask usado em providers/google-places-provider.ts
GET {{baseUrl}}/places/{{placeId}}?languageCode=pt-BR
X-Goog-Api-Key: {{$dotenv GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY}}
X-Goog-FieldMask: id,displayName,formattedAddress,addressComponents,location,nationalPhoneNumber,internationalPhoneNumber,websiteUri,rating,userRatingCount,regularOpeningHours,businessStatus,types,editorialSummary
